{"version":1,"content":"<p>中午12時許，石鼓洲旁人工島綜合廢物管理設施第一期發生火警，消防動用兩條喉及兩隊煙帽隊灌救。</p><p>火警於下午1時24分升為三級。</p><p>約900多名員工需疏散，坐船離開石鼓洲，其間一名年約60歲男子不適，由政府飛行服務隊直升機吊起送院。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T08:41:15.917778+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T06:59:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T08:38:05.783667+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T08:38:05.783667+00:00","content_hash":"829e74af00bf5ade60566ffbf6fe2092e74d0cde2469170e82b636607b79df7a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}